{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>Take your staff.</b> It is the staff of Moses that was given to him. And the proof is \"Say to Aaron, Take your staff and stretch out your hand\" (Exodus 7:19), and it is written, \"And he raised the staff and struck the waters\" (Exodus 7:20). Now, he has informed us by the opening of the bet [in במטה] that it is the known staff about which He said to him, Take your staff. And furthermore, \"and your staff with which you struck the river\" (Exodus 17:5)."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:32:20.110602332Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}